**`Graph.java`** — `validateVertex` is now a single `private static` method on the outer `Graph` class taking `(vertex, vertexCount)`. Both `Graph.neighbors` and `Builder.addEdge` delegate to it. Since `Builder` is a nested class, it has access to the outer class's private statics — the duplication is gone with no visibility changes needed.

